                  </td>

                  <td class="py-4 px-4 text-right space-x-2">

                    <a 

                      href="/api/marketplace/buyer/download?slug=n8n-ai-lead-enricher-waterfall" 

                      download 

                      class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-cyan-500 hover:bg-cyan-400 text-slate-950 font-bold transition-all inline-flex items-center gap-1"

                    >

                      <span>⬇️</span> Télécharger

                    </a>

                    <a href="/templates/n8n-ai-lead-enricher-waterfall/" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700 transition-all inline-flex items-center gap-1">

                      <span>📖</span> Doc

                    </a>

                  </td>

                </tr>

                <tr class="hover:bg-slate-900/40 transition-colors">

                  <td class="py-4 px-4">

                    <div class="font-bold text-white text-sm">Make.com Stripe Failed Payment Recovery &amp; Smart Churn Rescue</div>

                    <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Par SaaSGrowth Ops • Acheté le 25 Oct 2026</div>

                  </td>

                  <td class="py-4 px-4">

                    <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-400 border border-purple-500/30 text-[10px] font-bold">MAKE</span>

                  </td>

                  <td class="py-4 px-4">

                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">

